    {
        "Id": 166,
        "ActionId": 166,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>神威</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 167,
        "ActionId": 167,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>这封信，是妈妈和爸爸单独留给你的。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 168,
        "ActionId": 168,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>我们讨论了很久，最终还是决定把给你和阿撒尔的信分开。这种时候，我们还是更希望尊重你们作为个体的权利。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 169,
        "ActionId": 169,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>先说我自己的部分吧，你爸的内容在后面。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 170,
        "ActionId": 170,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>首先是……对不起。巴利康计划的事，我们没想刻意瞒着，只是一直没找到合适的时机说。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 171,
        "ActionId": 171,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>你们应该已经察觉到，在试炼前我们就参与进去了，本想着等回来立马告诉你们，但……</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 172,
        "ActionId": 172,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>帕弥什那鬼东西来得太快，让人措手不及。这世界的一切都乱了，埃则忒没一个人能有喘息的时间，我们不能停下。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            -2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 173,
        "ActionId": 173,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>而且我们不后悔。巴利康计划对抵抗帕弥什的帮助是意外之喜，听到这消息的那一刻，我们就庆幸能为你们铺好路。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 174,
        "ActionId": 174,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>你们参与的会是改良过的版本。放心，作为第一批训练者，我们已经替你们试错了足够的风险。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 175,
        "ActionId": 175,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>我们爱你们，但时间太短暂，我们的身体也撑不下去了。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 176,
        "ActionId": 176,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>现在我们基本宣告了再无转换成功的可能，所以在必要的时刻，你们必须放弃我们。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 177,
        "ActionId": 177,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>剩下的……让你爸来说。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 178,
        "ActionId": 178,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>神威，我是爸爸，别难过。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 179,
        "ActionId": 179,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>我知道当你看到此处，心情一定已经十分难受——</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 180,
        "ActionId": 180,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>但孩子，前面的路还很长，你必须学会在没有我们的时候，也能自己走下去。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 181,
        "ActionId": 181,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>接上妈妈刚才提到的。如果你有机会看到这封信，应该是我们已经离开埃则忒的时候了。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 182,
        "ActionId": 182,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>结局会怎样，连我们自己也不能断言——我们无力再为你们保障与承诺，这便是这封信产生的原因。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 183,
        "ActionId": 183,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>等世界政府的军队抵达，他们会尽力为我们剔除日冕基因的影响。如果运气好，我们还能接受传闻中的构造体改造。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 184,
        "ActionId": 184,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>但即使如此，我们也不能留在埃则忒，应该会去其他地方上前线。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 185,
        "ActionId": 185,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>而另一种可能，我知道你不爱听，就不彻底说破了。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            -2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 186,
        "ActionId": 186,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>或许，我们没有有机会好好道别，这封信是我们对你所能力及的弥补。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 187,
        "ActionId": 187,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>这大概就是我们的终点，却不能是你的，孩子。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 188,
        "ActionId": 188,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>你们仍有希望，我希望你能在巴利康计划中迎来转机，好好地活下去。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 189,
        "ActionId": 189,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>还记得你小时候最爱听的故事吗？太阳的出生不是平凡的，它必定要吞下数不尽的黑暗，才能成就足够耀眼的光芒。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 190,
        "ActionId": 190,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>这黑暗可能来自于天地，来自于曾经和他一样试图成为太阳的同胞。过程必然是痛苦，但他不能回头。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 191,
        "ActionId": 191,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>我们已经注定是黑暗，所以不必为我们太过伤心。替我们继续走下去吧，神威。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 192,
        "ActionId": 192,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>我亲爱的孩子，我们看不到的太阳和美好家园，你会替我们去看到的。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 193,
        "ActionId": 193,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>▇▄▃▆▃▁▁▁▁</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 194,
        "ActionId": 194,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>——当然，你明白的，神威，我们对你的期许远远不止这些。你的身上不仅有自己，更肩负着埃则忒的未来。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 195,
        "ActionId": 195,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>你和阿撒尔，你们都必须，也只能成为那个太阳——这是唯一的出路。否则，过往的一切将没有任何意义。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 196,
        "ActionId": 196,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>——你不会辜负我们的期待，对吗？你说过的，神威，你会一直都是我们的骄傲。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 197,
        "ActionId": 197,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "<i>我们签署了自愿将遗体捐献给研究提供数据的协议。</i>",
            "000000ff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStoryFront/BgStoryFront48.png",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 198,
        "ActionId": 198,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
